{"id":"wb-5-406","name":"筇竹寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"筇竹寺","text":"筇竹寺是位于云南省昆明市城西玉案山上的一座佛教寺庙，为禅宗传入云南的第一寺。寺庙主体结构包括天王殿、大雄宝殿、华严阁及两侧厢房。2001年，筇竹寺被国务院列入第五批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%AD%87%E7%AB%B9%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":86081235,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86081235","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/32e40a113733962eca2f9c78.jpg","title":"QiongZhu_Main_Building_JD2013.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:QiongZhu_Main_Building_JD2013.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3e/QiongZhu_Main_Building_JD2013.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Jan Drewes","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"The main building of the QiongZhu temple northwest of Kunming, China","width":320,"height":214}}